  "id": "audience",
  "term": "audience",
  "definition": "In this context, an audience is the group of observers who watch a performance and form judgments about it. Research described here treats the audience as perceivers whose evaluations of expressivity, emotion, and performance quality can be influenced by the performer’s visible movements as well as the sound.",
